A process of lib/c's has one thread, which owns every FILE: flockfile,
ftrylockfile and funlockfile take no lock, and a FILE has none made
(PTHREAD_RECURSIVE_MUTEX_INITIALIZER_NP is not lib/c's: its mutex is the
kernel's object). Every getc and putc would otherwise be two calls of the
kernel. The list of FILEs keeps its mutex.

